A '''Fiesta Flask''' is a {{Legendary}} consumable.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Fiesta Flask''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Brynmor}} in the {{Zone|Dwarven Tavern}} while {{NPCSprite|Cole}}'s [[Mining Fiesta]] perk is active. It costs {{Coins|2.5m}} with a stock of {{Green|5}} per mayorship.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Consumable
|rarity = u
|special_effect =Consume while Mayor {{NPCSprite|Mayor Cole}}'s {{AN|Mining Fiesta}} perk is active to gain the following effects:
* {{stat|mnf|+25%}}
* {{Green|+100%}} chance of finding {{Item|Refined Mineral}}s
* {{Green|+100%}} chance of finding {{Item|Glossy Gemstone}}s
Duration: {{Green|60m}}
}}
Only one can be consumed at a time. Stacks additively with the [[Mining Fiesta]] perk. Despite its description, it can be bought and used while {{NPC|Cole}} is elected as a [[Mayor_Election#Mayors_and_Ministers|Minister]].

If the effect remains on the player without a Mining Fiesta active, the effect's duration will not go down. 

== Trivia ==
* The '''Fiesta Flask''' was added by {{RN|MVP++|zj2}} as part of the [[Minister Election]]s.

